The Groovy Coop: 30 s ad

Fonts
- Bungee, by David Jonathan Ross. SIL Open Font License 1.1. https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Bungee
- Shrikhand, by Jonny Pinhorn. SIL Open Font License 1.1. https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Shrikhand

Music and sound
- Score and sound effects synthesised in code (mix.py; procedural sound helpers from the Lemo-Opuscar
  library's core/audio/sfx.py). No samples or recordings.

Pictures
- All tiles, patterns and icons drawn in code (art.js, index.html). The customer review photos the user
  shared were used as reference only and do not appear in the film.
- The shop name is set in Bungee as a placeholder; the business's own logo is not yet included.
